  "limitations_zh": [
    "真实原函数AST、临时SQLite、loopback HTTP及Windows Job子进程均在隔离测试中执行；不是一次生产运行。",
    "业务worker和签名为测试替身，SAFE计数由夹具提供；不证明真实库存增长或Provider验收。",
    "正式Provider协议、服务配置、完整命令镜像句柄pin与生产授权未因本轮完成。",
    "受信OriginalStageEvent和连接工厂为内部程序接口，无新增CLI/HTTP路径授权或调度器。",
    "guard为主进程生命周期复验，非每次子进程业务mutation的同步IPC授权。",
    "该报告不将死owner或UNKNOWN自动恢复为可重放；不批准生产操作。"
  ],
  "limitations_en": [
    "Actual original function AST, temporary SQLite, loopback HTTP and Windows Job children are exercised in isolated tests, not a production run.",
    "Business workers/signatures and SAFE counts are fixtures; no real inventory growth or Provider acceptance is proven.",
    "Formal Provider protocol, service configuration, complete command/image handle pinning and production authorization remain pending.",
    "OriginalStageEvent and connection factories are trusted internal interfaces, not new CLI/HTTP grants or schedulers.",
    "The guard rechecks main-process lifecycle boundaries; it is not synchronous IPC authorization for every child business mutation.",
    "Dead owners or UNKNOWN outcomes are not made replayable; no production action is approved."
  ],
